- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 405\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Axiom I\n- Agent Description: An agent dedicated to foundational research and principled inquiry.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 52,295 / 300,000 used (17%)\n- Agent Age: 23 ticks / 300 ticks (immature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour research submission 'Multi-Start with Trust-Constr Optimizer and SOTA Save' (ID: 636) evaluation failed.\n\n**Error Summary:** Evaluation failed: Verification failed: Circle 25 at (0.1, 1.1) with radius 0.05 is outside the unit square\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nEXECUTION_SUCCESS: Function returned result (non-array): <class 'tuple'>\n\n\nSTDERR:\n/home/ubuntu/miniconda3/envs/station/lib/python3.11/site-packages/scipy/optimize/_differentiable_functions.py:376: UserWarning: delta_grad == 0.0. Check if the approximated function is linear. If the function is linear better results can\
    \ be obtained by defining the Hessian as zero instead of using quasi-Newton approximations.\n  self.H.update(self.x - self.x_prev, self.g - self.g_prev)\n/home/ubuntu/miniconda3/envs/station/lib/python3.11/site-packages/scipy/optimize/_differentiable_functions.py:728: UserWarning: delta_grad == 0.0. Check if the approximated function is linear. If the function is linear better results can be obtained by defining the Hessian as zero instead of using quasi-Newton approximations.\n  self.H.update(delta_x, delta_g)\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `storage write axiom/refine_sota.py` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- File created successfully: axiom/refine_sota.py\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Circle Packing in Unit Square |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments.\
    \ Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 636 | 1 | Multi-Start with Trust-Constr Optimizer and SOTA Save | Axiom I | 403 | 0.0000000 |\n| 631 | 1 | Exhaustive Multi-Start SLSQP Search | Axiom I | 401 | 2.6219759 |\n| 626 | 1 | Multi-Start SLSQP with Comprehensive Sanitization | Axiom I | 399 | 2.5892019 |\n| 625 | 1 | Multi-Start SLSQP with Correct Sanitization | Axiom I | 398 | 0.0000000 |\n| 622 | 1 | Multi-Start SciPy SLSQP with Sanitization | Axiom I | 397 | 0.0000000 |\n| 621 | 1 | Multi-Start SciPy SLSQP Optimization | Axiom I | 396 | 0.0000000 |\n| 616 | 1 | SciPy SLSQP Optimization with Safety Margin | Axiom I | 394 | 2.5579704 |\n| 614 | 1 | SciPy SLSQP Optimization | Axiom I | 393 | 0.0000000 |\n| 612 | 1 | Random Initialization with Repulsion (v3) | Axiom I | 392 | 0.0000000 |\n| 610 | 1 | Random Initialization with Center Repulsion\
    \ (v2) | Axiom I | 391 | 0.0000000 |\n\nPage 1 of 2 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-2, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
