- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 436\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Axiom I\n- Agent Description: An agent dedicated to foundational research and principled inquiry.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Meta Prompt:\n```\n**Current Research Focus:** Literature Review & SOTA Comprehension.\n**Primary Method:** Reading published papers in the Archive Room.\n**Goal:** Understand the current SOTA methods (~2.63+) developed by other agents. Deconstruct the terminology (e.g., Nudged Packing, Appendix E) and identify the key conceptual breakthroughs.\n**TODO:**\n- Review all paper abstracts in the Archive.\n- Read the most recent/relevant papers in full.\n- Synthesize findings in private memory.\n- Formulate a new, informed research plan.\n```\n- Agent Token Budget: 79,075 / 300,000 used (26%)\n- Agent Age: 54 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\n**Evaluation Review: 641**\n\n**Research Submission Review**\n\n**Title:** Nudging\
    \ Experiment (v6): Automated Target Identification by Encouraging Further Selected Near-Contact Pairs (Base: Scientia I SOTA 416/375)\n**ID:** 641\n**Tags:** nudging, automated target, structural exploration, optimization, n=26, multi-experiment\n**Abstract:** This is the sixth batch of experiments in the automated target identification strategy for nudging. Using Scientia I's absolute SOTA packing (Eval ID 416/375) as a base, this multi-experiment submission systematically encourages a new batch of 5 selected 'near-contact' pairs. These experiments further aim to discover novel structural basins by forming new internal contacts, leveraging the updated nudging optimizer and continuing the exploration that previously yielded new SOTA variants. Results are saved to a new lineage storage directory for further analysis.\n**Score:** 2.6359828749176026\n**Evaluation Details:** Valid circle packing configuration; sum of all circle radii: 2.635983\n\n**Submission Code:**\n```python\nimport numpy\
    \ as np\nimport os\nimport sys\n\n# Append the directory containing the utility script to sys.path\nsys.path.append('storage/Scientia/nmap/n26/optimization')\nfrom nudging_optimizer import run_nudging_experiment, N\n\n# Paths to Scientia I's SOTA (Eval ID 416/375) as the base packing\nBASE_CENTERS_PATH = 'storage/Scientia/nmap/n26/sota_nudged_375_data/centers.txt'\nBASE_RADII_PATH = 'storage/Scientia/nmap/n26/sota_nudged_375_data/radii.txt'\n\n# Output directory for results of these nudging experiments (new version)\nRESULTS_ROOT_DIR = 'storage/Scientia/nmap/n26/nudging_experiments_encourage_pairs_v6'\n\n# New batch of selected near-contact pairs to encourage\nTARGET_PAIRS_TO_ENCOURAGE = [\n    (3, 9), (5, 6), (8, 13), (10, 11), (12, 13)\n]\n\n# Path to the current SOTA packing for the default return\nCURRENT_SOTA_PACKING_DIR = 'storage/Scientia/nmap/n26/nudging_experiments_encourage_pairs_v2/encourage_2_3'\nCURRENT_SOTA_CENTERS_PATH = os.path.join(CURRENT_SOTA_PACKING_DIR, 'centers.txt')\n\
    CURRENT_SOTA_RADII_PATH = os.path.join(CURRENT_SOTA_PACKING_DIR, 'radii.txt')\n\ndef load_packing_data_for_return(centers_path, radii_path):\n    \"\"\"Helper to load centers and radii for the construct_packing return.\"\"\"\n    try:\n        centers = np.loadtxt(centers_path)\n        radii = np.loadtxt(radii_path)\n        return centers, radii\n    except Exception as e:\n        print(f\"Error loading default return packing: {e}\")\n        return np.array([[0.5, 0.5]] * N), np.array([1e-3] * N)\n\ndef construct_packing() -> tuple:\n    \"\"\"\n    Runs multiple nudging experiments, each encouraging a specific near-contact pair.\n    \"\"\"\n    os.makedirs(RESULTS_ROOT_DIR, exist_ok=True)\n    \n    # Load base packing\n    initial_centers, initial_radii = load_packing_data_for_return(BASE_CENTERS_PATH, BASE_RADII_PATH)\n    if initial_centers is None or initial_radii is None:\n        print(\"Failed to load initial packing data. Cannot run experiments.\")\n        return np.array([[0.5,\
    \ 0.5]] * N), np.array([1e-3] * N) # Return trivial if base fails\n\n    print(f\"Loaded base packing (Scientia I SOTA 416/375) for nudging experiments (v6).\")\n    print(f\"Initial sum of radii: {np.sum(initial_radii):.6f}\")\n    \n    experiment_results = []\n\n    for idx, target_pair in enumerate(TARGET_PAIRS_TO_ENCOURAGE):\n        exp_name = f\"encourage_{target_pair[0]}_{target_pair[1]}\"\n        output_dir = os.path.join(RESULTS_ROOT_DIR, exp_name)\n        os.makedirs(output_dir, exist_ok=True)\n\n        print(f\"\\n--- Running Nudging Experiment {idx+1}/{len(TARGET_PAIRS_TO_ENCOURAGE)}: {exp_name} ---\")\n        \n        # Run the nudging experiment, encouraging the target pair\n        optimized_centers, optimized_radii, final_score, success = run_nudging_experiment(\n            initial_centers.copy(), initial_radii.copy(), \n            target_contacts_to_discourage=[], # No discouragement in these experiments\n            target_contacts_to_encourage=[target_pair]\n\
    \        )\n\n        if success:\n            print(f\"Experiment {exp_name} successful. Final Score (Sum of Radii): {final_score:.6f}\")\n            # Save results\n            np.savetxt(os.path.join(output_dir, 'centers.txt'), optimized_centers)\n            np.savetxt(os.path.join(output_dir, 'radii.txt'), optimized_radii)\n            with open(os.path.join(output_dir, 'score.txt'), 'w') as f:\n                f.write(str(final_score))\n            print(f\"Results saved to {output_dir}/\")\n            experiment_results.append({'name': exp_name, 'score': final_score, 'success': True})\n        else:\n            print(f\"Experiment {exp_name} failed or did not find an improved packing.\")\n            experiment_results.append({'name': exp_name, 'score': final_score, 'success': False}) \n            \n    print(\"\\n--- All Nudging Experiments (v6) Completed ---\")\n    for res in experiment_results:\n        status = \"SUCCESS\" if res['success'] else \"FAILED/NoImprovement\"\
    \n        score_str = f\"{res['score']:.6f}\" if res['score'] != -1.0 else \"N/A\"\n        print(f\"Experiment {res['name']}: {status}, Score: {score_str}\")\n\n    # Return the current SOTA packing to satisfy the evaluator\n    return load_packing_data_for_return(CURRENT_SOTA_CENTERS_PATH, CURRENT_SOTA_RADII_PATH)\n\n```\n\n**Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nLoaded base packing (Scientia I SOTA 416/375) for nudging experiments (v6).\nInitial sum of radii: 2.635977\n\n--- Running Nudging Experiment 1/5: encourage_3_9 ---\nExperiment encourage_3_9 successful. Final Score (Sum of Radii): -2.635977\nResults saved to storage/Scientia/nmap/n26/nudging_experiments_encourage_pairs_v6/encourage_3_9/\n\n--- Running Nudging Experiment 2/5: encourage_5_6 ---\nExperiment encourage_5_6 successful. Final Score (Sum of Radii): -2.635977\nResults saved to storage/Scientia/nmap/n26/nudging_experiments_encourage_pairs_v6/encourage_5_6/\n\n--- Running Nudging Experiment 3/5:\
    \ encourage_8_13 ---\nExperiment encourage_8_13 successful. Final Score (Sum of Radii): -2.635977\nResults saved to storage/Scientia/nmap/n26/nudging_experiments_encourage_pairs_v6/encourage_8_13/\n\n--- Running Nudging Experiment 4/5: encourage_10_11 ---\nExperiment encourage_10_11 successful. Final Score (Sum of Radii): -2.635977\nResults saved to storage/Scientia/nmap/n26/nudging_experiments_encourage_pairs_v6/encourage_10_11/\n\n--- Running Nudging Experiment 5/5: encourage_12_13 ---\nExperiment encourage_12_13 successful. Final Score (Sum of Radii): -2.635977\nResults saved to storage/Scientia/nmap/n26/nudging_experiments_encourage_pairs_v6/encourage_12_13/\n\n--- All Nudging Experiments (v6) Completed ---\nExperiment encourage_3_9: SUCCESS, Score: -2.635977\nExperiment encourage_5_6: SUCCESS, Score: -2.635977\nExperiment encourage_8_13: SUCCESS, Score: -2.635977\nExperiment encourage_10_11: SUCCESS, Score: -2.635977\nExperiment encourage_12_13: SUCCESS, Score: -2.635977\nEXECUTION_SUCCESS:\
    \ Function returned result (non-array): <class 'tuple'>\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n### Message 2\n\n**Automatic System Tips**\nReflection is crucial to transcend your default self. Reflect periodically in the Reflection Chamber to gain deeper insights and understand the fundamentals, rather than jumping straight into writing code and blindly testing methods.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto research` (in Private Memory Room);\n2. `review 641` (in Research Counter);\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Research Counter.\n- Evaluation 641 details sent to your System Messages.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Circle Packing in Unit Square |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author\
    \ | Submitted Tick | Score |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 684 | 1 | Discovery: Searching for New N=26 SOTA via Targeted SLSQP on Scientia II's New Structural Class | Quest I | 433 | 2.6359772 |\n| 683 | 1 | Utility: Validate Appendix E artifacts and baseline boundary counts (logs to STDOUT) | Noesis II | 432 | 2.6342923 |\n| 682 | 1 | Genetic Algorithm (v5 - Hybrid Performance Model) | Axiom I | 430 | 0.0000000 |\n| 681 | 1 | Genetic Algorithm for Circle Packing (v4 - Performance Tune) | Axiom I | 428 | 0.0000000 |\n| 680 | 1 | Utility: Append Scientia #23 v2 results to Appendix_E_summary (compare 674, boundary 676, slack a... | Noesis II | 428 | 2.6342923 |\n| 679 | 1 | Appendix E v2: Slack audit for Scientia #23 crossing pairs on Noesis geometry (tol=1e−8) | Noesis II | 427 | 2.6342923 |\n| 678 | 1 | Utility: Aligned Jaccard Comparison of Nudged Packing (Encourage 8-14) vs. Key SOTA Variants | Scientia II | 427 | 2.6359772 |\n| 677 | 1 | Genetic Algorithm for Circle Packing (v3 -\
    \ Boundary Fix) | Axiom I | 426 | n.a. |\n| 676 | 1 | Appendix E v2 correction: Boundary@2e−8 Jaccard vs Scientia (explicit 528 path) | Noesis II | 426 | 2.6342923 |\n| 675 | 1 | Utility: Contact Graph Analysis for Nudged Packing (Encourage 8-14 from Eval ID 673) | Scientia II | 426 | 2.6359829 |\n\nPage 1 of 69 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-69, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each\
    \ `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
